\contentsline {added}{Added: \truncate {\Changestruncatewidth }{The recorded value is, of course, affected by the crack pattern inside the explicitly resolved microstructure; however, following the observation reported by Hossain et al.\nobreakspace {}\cite {hossain_effective_2014}, the additional homogeneous surrounding material is assumed not to change the value of the boundary J-Integral, so that evaluating it at the boundary of the resolved microstructure or at the boundary of an embedding region with representative effective properties gives the same macroscopic driving force.}}{6}{section*.73}%
