\contentsline {added}{Added: \truncate {\Changestruncatewidth }{During phases in which the crack is trapped inside a pore, this definition places $x_{ct}$ at the last fully damaged material point before the void. A different convention could assign the crack tip to the opposite side of the open pore, but the present definition is used consistently as a tracking quantity for the advance through intact material ligaments.}}{20}{section*.154}%
