\contentsline {added}{Added: \truncate {\Changestruncatewidth }{The smoother behavior is consistent with the crack-front evolution shown in Fig.\nobreakspace {}\ref {fig:position_3D}: in contrast to the two-dimensional case in Fig.\nobreakspace {}\ref {fig:PAPER_00_xct_pf_vs_xct_KI_diamond}, the crack front can propagate between pores and is not trapped completely by a pore.}}{24}{section*.199}%
