\contentsline {added}{Added: \truncate {\Changestruncatewidth }{A further essential step is to investigate representativity more systematically, including variations of the initial crack position, crack-growth direction, microstructure realization, and domain size. Such studies are required before the operational effective crack resistance used here can be assessed as a material property in a stronger homogenization sense.}}{27}{section*.232}%
\contentsline {added}{Added: \truncate {\Changestruncatewidth }{A more detailed separation of the individual mechanisms, in particular stress-driven crack nucleation under plasticity, plastic dissipation during ligament failure, and subsequent crack growth between pores, should also be addressed in future work.}}{27}{section*.233}%
